Description:
    Generates a new Radiant CMS extension as a Rails Engine gem.

Example:
    bin/rails generate radiant:extension archive

    This will create:
        radiant-archive/lib/radiant/archive.rb           (entry point)
        radiant-archive/lib/radiant/archive/engine.rb    (engine class)
        radiant-archive/radiant-archive.gemspec
        radiant-archive/Gemfile
        radiant-archive/README.md
        radiant-archive/config/routes.rb
        radiant-archive/test/test_helper.rb
